 "```lean\ncase vc1\nxs : List Nat\n⊢ 0 = [].sum\n```\n---\n```lean\ncase vc3\nxs pref : List Nat\nx : Nat\nsuff✝ : List Nat\n_h✝ : ForIn.toList xs = pref ++ x :: suff✝\nacc✝¹ : Nat\nacc✝ : Nat := pref.sum\nacc : Nat := acc✝ + x\n⊢ acc = (pref ++ [x]).sum\n```",
