{"rendered":
 "```lean\ncase vc1\nl : List Nat\nr : Nat\nh : sumDef l = r\n⊢ 0 + l.sum = l.sum\n```\n---\n```lean\ncase vc3\nl : List Nat\nr : Nat\nh : sumDef l = r\npref✝ : List Nat\ncur✝ : Nat\nsuff✝ : List Nat\n_h✝ : l = pref✝ ++ cur✝ :: suff✝\nb✝ : Nat\na✝ : b✝ + (cur✝ :: suff✝).sum = l.sum\nacc : Nat := b✝ + cur✝\n⊢ acc + suff✝.sum = l.sum\n```",
 "goals":
 ["case vc1\nl : List Nat\nr : Nat\nh : sumDef l = r\n⊢ 0 + l.sum = l.sum",
  "case vc3\nl : List Nat\nr : Nat\nh : sumDef l = r\npref✝ : List Nat\ncur✝ : Nat\nsuff✝ : List Nat\n_h✝ : l = pref✝ ++ cur✝ :: suff✝\nb✝ : Nat\na✝ : b✝ + (cur✝ :: suff✝).sum = l.sum\nacc : Nat := b✝ + cur✝\n⊢ acc + suff✝.sum = l.sum"]}
